---
export const prerender = true;

import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';

const title = `Terms | ${SITE.name}`;
const description = `Terms of use for the ${SITE.name} website.`;
const updated = '26 October 2026';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} canonicalPath="/terms/">
  <section class="legal-hero" aria-labelledby="terms-title">
    <div class="container-narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="display-lg" id="terms-title">Website terms</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: {updated}</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-sm tone-paper">
    <div class="container-narrow legal-body">
      <p>
        These terms cover your use of the {SITE.name} website. Paid engagements are governed by
        a separate written scope and agreement, which takes priority for anything about the
        work itself.
      </p>

      <h2>Information on this site</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to keep everything accurate and useful, but website content is general
        information, not advice tailored to your business. Nothing on this site creates a
        professional relationship, an obligation to work together, or a guarantee of results.
      </p>

      <h2>Demonstrations and figures</h2>
      <p>
        Every dashboard, metric, heatmap, experiment result, conversation and storefront shown
        on this site is an illustrative demonstration built with fictional data. It does not
        represent real client results, real experiments or real visitor activity. We do not
        publish invented case studies or testimonials.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The site's copy, design, illustrations and original imagery belong to {SITE.name} unless
        noted otherwise. You are welcome to quote short extracts with attribution. Republishing
        the site wholesale, or using its assets as your own, is not permitted.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party names</h2>
      <p>
        Names of platforms and products (for example Google Analytics, Google Tag Manager or
        Shopify) belong to their respective owners and are used only to describe the services
        we work with. No endorsement or affiliation is implied.
      </p>

      <h2>Links to other websites</h2>
      <p>
        Where we link out, we do so for reference. We are not responsible for content,
        availability or practices on third-party sites we do not control.
      </p>

      <h2>Availability</h2>
      <p>
        We keep the site running sensibly but cannot promise uninterrupted access. Maintenance,
        hosting outages and matters outside our control may take it offline temporarily.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(7.5rem, 14vh, 9.5rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
    background: var(--color-paper);
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    margin-top: 1.2rem;
  }

  .legal-updated {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-ink-3);
  }
</style>
